<title>USA: Choice Hotels stake raised by Baron.</title>
<headline>Choice Hotels stake raised by Baron.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group controlled by New York investor Ronald Baron said Tuesday it had increased its stake in Choice Hotels Holdings Inc to 21.7 percent or 13,647,383 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Baron said his group most recently acquired 1,053,600 shares of the Silver Spring, Md. company between June 20 and June 30 at $15.76 to $16.33 each.</p>
</text>
